{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>נאדרי.</b> The yod is added like the yod of אכזרי (Proverbs 11:7)." "And it says פעמים ימינך ה', like the sense of כי הנה אויביך ה' (Psalms 92:9), נשאו נהרות (ibid. 93:3), and the meaning is: time after time, פעמים without number — You will do thus: Your right hand will shatter the enemy." "Now, נאדרי בכח — it is the revered Name [of God]. And some say it refers back to 'Your right hand.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :register {:flags {2 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:38.918193397Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}